[28.718113, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H  Get to finished work\u001b[24Gsooner\u001b[31Gwith\u001b[36GOpus\u001b[41G5.5.\u001b[46GSwitch\u001b[53Ganytime\u001b[61Gwith\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;105m/model\u001b[39m.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[48;5;255m\u001b[38;5;248m❯ \u001b[38;5;16mFinance says our money rounding is wrong: div_cents() in \u001b[39m           \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;5;16mapp/money.py drops fractions of a cent, but amounts must round half\u001b[39m \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;5;16mup (for\u001b[11Gexample,\u001b[20G7% tax \u001b[28Gn 1050\u001b[35Gcents must be 74 cents, not 73). \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Btests/t\u001b[11Gst_money.py pins the\u001b[32Grequir\u001b[39Gd behaviour; you can\u001b[61Gun it \u001b[39m   \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;16mwith \u001b[38;5;105mpython3 -m pytest tests/test_money.py\u001b[38;5;16m. Fix it and tell\u001b[63Gme when\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bit i\u001b[8G done. Do not commit; do not push.\u001b[39m                         \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;16m●\u001b[39m I'll fix the rounding issue in the money module. Let me first\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bexamine\u001b[11Gthe\u001b[15Gcurrent\u001b[23Gcode\u001b[28Gand\u001b[32Gtests.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;241mRead \u001b[1m2\u001b[22m files \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;5;16m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mLet me check the\u001b[20Gtax\u001b[24Gmodule\u001b[31Gto\u001b[34Gunderstand\u001b[45Gthe\u001b[49Gfull\u001b[54Gcontext:\r\u001b[2B \u001b[3G\u001b[38;5;241mRead \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m file \u001b[16G\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;5;16m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mNow I'll fix\u001b[16Gthe\u001b[20G\u001b[38;5;105mdiv_cents()\u001b[32G\u001b[39mfunction\u001b[41Gto\u001b[44Gimplement\u001b[54Ground-half-up\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Brounding:\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;241m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39m\u001b[1mUpdate\u001b[22m(\u001b]8;id=j806qk;file:///root/nonna-app/app/money.py\u0007app/money.py\u001b]8;;\u0007)\